[64.286124, "o", "\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mWaiting for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m background\u001b[28Gagent to finish\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;114m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAgent \"Fix paginate\u001b[23Goff-by-one\u001b[34G·\u001b[36Ghaiku\"\u001b[43Gfinished\u001b[38;5;246m · 23s\r\u001b[2B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;246mThought for \u001b[1m9s\u001b[22m, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe fix is committed on a new branch, \u001b[38;5;153mfix-paginate-off-by-one\u001b[39m (commit \u001b[38;5;153mb589bca\u001b[39m). I checked\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdiff, the\u001b[13Gcommit\u001b[20Gand the tests myself.\u001b[42GNothing\u001b[50Gwas\u001b[54Gpushed,\u001b[62Gand\u001b[66G\u001b[38;5;153mmain\u001b[71G\u001b[39mwas\u001b[75Gnot\u001b[79Gtouched.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B- \u001b[1mBug:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;5;153mpaginate.js\u001b[39m set\u001b[26Gt\u001b[29G start\u001b[36Gindex\u001b[43Go \u001b[38;5;153mpage * size\u001b[39m, but pag\u001b[67Gnu\u001b[70Gbers start a\u001b[83G 1.\u001b[87GSo page 2\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bskipped\u001b[13Gahead\u001b[19Gand\u001b[23Greturned\u001b[32G\u001b[38;5;153m[5]\u001b[36G\u001b[39minstead\u001b[44Gof\u001b[47G\u001b[38;5;153m[3, 4]\u001b[39m.\u001b[55GThe\u001b[59Gfix\u001b[63Gis\u001b[66G\u001b[38;5;153m(page - 1) * size\u001b[39m,\u001b[85Ga\u001b[87Gone-line\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G  change.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mTest:\u001b[11G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;153mpaginate.test.js\u001b[28G\u001b[39mhas\u001b[32Ga\u001b[34Gnew\u001b[38G\"second\u001b[46Gpage\"\u001b[52Gtest\u001b[57Gexpecting\u001b[67G\u001b[38;5;153m[3, 4]\u001b[39m.\u001b[75GThe\u001b[79GWorker\u001b[86Gran\u001b[90Gthe\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G  original\u001b[14Gcode \u001b[20Ggainst it a\u001b[32Gd\u001b[34Ggot \u001b[38;5;153m[5]\u001b[39m,\u001b[43Gso the test fails\u001b[61Gon\u001b[64Gthe\u001b[68Gold\u001b[72Gcode.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mTests:\u001b[12G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;153mnpm test\u001b[21G\u001b[39mgives\u001b[27G2\u001b[29Gpassed,\u001b[37G0\u001b[39Gfailed.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  The commit is credited to Haiku 5.5 instead of the Opus 5.5 line I asked for. The Worker changed\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bit\u001b[6Gbecause Haiku wrote the commit, which is accurate, so I left it. I can amend the credit line if\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Byou want Opus.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3GI can push the branch and open a PR if you\u001b[46Gwant.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;174m·\u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;180mShimmying…\u001b[38;5;174m \u001b[38;5;246m(running Stop hook · 10s · ↓\u001b[43G128 tokens · \u001b[38;5;249mthinking\u001b[38;5;246m)\u001b[39m\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H"]
